# The offscreen scene target (v0.0.19, the workspace viewport's path): the
# frame drawn into a texture of a given size instead of the window, then
# back. Captures of the same view, direct and offscreen at the window's
# size, are written to out/img/ (compared when M122 landed: identical but
# for the spinning cubes); the run also proves the texture is resized and
# released cleanly (the GPU lifetime check at exit fails it otherwise).
expect_level hello
set post grade
teleport 0 0 4 0
wait 0.3
screenshot scene_direct
set scene_target 1280x720
wait 0.3
screenshot scene_offscreen
set scene_target 640x360
wait 0.2
set scene_target 960x540
wait 0.2
set scene_target off
wait 0.2
log hello scene target done
